# Wave W17-Z (Route 215): puddle sand — the puddled path’s sand, design-authorised: a pale sand darkened in wet patches where the puddles sit, running Repose’s road north to Shardfall under the falling shards (design: the Shardfall road, its puddles keeping the sky). Split from Route 214’s dry verge sand by the wet entire and from Farewell Spring’s bent sand by the sky in it: this sand holds water, that one holds a curve.
